  "caption": "ChatGPT Go free khatam ho raha hai. ₹399 har mahine katne se pehle ye 2 minute ka kaam karo.\nNov 2025 se Jan 2026 ke beech ChatGPT Go free India offer liya tha? To 1 saal baad plan auto renew hoga.\n\nKya karna hai:\n1. ChatGPT > Settings > Billing mein apni renew date dekho (joining se 12 mahine)\n2. Jahan se liya wahi se cancel karo: Web pe Billing > Cancel plan, Android pe Play Store > Subscriptions, iPhone pe Settings > apna naam > Subscriptions\n3. UPI app mein AutoPay mandate bhi check karo\n4. Renew date se kam se kam 1 din pehle karna\n\nSach: app delete karne se plan cancel nahi hota. Paisa kat gaya to refund milna mushkil hai. Cancel ke baad bhi free ChatGPT chalta rahega, bas photo aur file ki limit kam. Zaroorat ho to ₹399 do, warna saal ke ₹4,788 bachao.\n\nJis dost ne free liya tha usko bhejo. Apni date batao, comment mein GO likho, sabko reply karunga.\n\n#aitools #chatgpthindi #chatgptgo #aitoolsforfree"
